  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters are divided into nine ranks of great realms, and each great realm has four small realms: initial, middle, upper, and peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        230
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From the general aspect, ranks one to five are mortal, while six to nine are immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among ranks six through nine, rank eight sits second from the top.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank eight Gu Immortal’s leftover immortal essence is white litchi immortal essence. One hundred green grape immortal essence beads cannot compare to one white litchi immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-litchi-essence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal apertures of rank eight Gu Immortals create that white litchi immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-litchi-essence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_aperture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal apertures of rank six and rank seven Gu Immortals are blessed lands. Gu Immortal apertures at rank eight and rank nine are grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grotto-heaven-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals at rank eight no longer face earthly calamities. They face a heavenly tribulation every ten years, a grand tribulation every fifty years, and a myriad tribulation every one hundred years.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribulation-schedule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After three myriad tribulations, the text treats them as able to become the invincible rank nine Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribulation-schedule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The apex above this rank is covered on Rank Nine. The wider ladder is covered on ranks and realms. Gu Immortals from rank six up are covered on Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
